{"id":"buenas-password","title":"Buena's Password","description":"Complete guide to Buena's Password mini-game in Polished Crystal. Learn how to earn Blue Card points, daily password mechanics, and redeem points for rare items like Ultra Balls, Rare Candies, and Nuggets.","category":"items-services","hero":null,"html":"<h2 id=\"introduction\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#introduction\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Introduction</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Buena&#x27;s Password, meanwhile, is a daily mini-game one can participate in within the <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/locations/goldenrodcity\">Goldenrod Radio Tower</a> to receive Blue Card Points through correctly guessing its password. That can be turned in for a selection of pretty nice items, including Rare Candies, Ultra Balls, and Ability Capsules.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">This is a very low-effort daily activity that pays dividends throughout a playthrough, making it worth visiting every evening!</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#getting-started\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Getting Started</h2>\n<h3 id=\"prerequisites\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#prerequisites\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Prerequisites</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Access Required:</strong> Obtain the <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/radiocard\">Radio Card</a> from the Radio Tower receptionist. You can get the card on your first visit!</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Location:</strong> <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/locations/goldenrodcity\">Goldenrod Radio Tower</a>, 2nd Floor</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Time:</strong> 6:00 PM - 12:00 AM (Midnight)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Frequency:</strong> Once per day</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"how-to-start\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#how-to-start\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>How to Start</h3>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Visit the Goldenrod Radio Tower 2nd Floor between 6:00 PM and midnight</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Talk to <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Buena</strong> at her desk</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">She&#x27;ll give you a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Blue Card</strong> on your first visit</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Listen to her radio show for the daily password hint</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Return and guess the password for points</li>\n</ol>\n<!--$--><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-full w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\"></div></div></div><!--/$-->\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"password-mechanics\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#password-mechanics\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Password Mechanics</h2>\n<h3 id=\"finding-the-password\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#finding-the-password\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Finding the Password</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The password is a specfic word, such as a Pokémon or item. Buena says the password during her radio show:</p>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Tune your radio to <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Buena&#x27;s Password</strong> (automatic when talking to her)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Listen for the password</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Speak to Buena and repeat the password</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Tip:</strong> The password changes daily and is randomized, so there&#x27;s no pattern to memorize.</p>\n<h3 id=\"guessing-strategy\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#guessing-strategy\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Guessing Strategy</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Honestly, there isn&#x27;t much strategy to be had here. It&#x27;s a guessing game and Buena will tell you what the password is via the radio station. You can write it down, but otherwise this is super simple.</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"blue-card-points- and- rewards\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#blue-card-points--rewards\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Blue Card Points &amp; Rewards</h2>\n<h3 id=\"earning-points\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#earning-points\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Earning Points</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Correct Password:</strong> 1 point per day</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Points Accumulate:</strong> Save up for expensive items</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"prize-list\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#prize-list\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Prize List</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Points can be redeemed for items at Buena&#x27;s desk:</p>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mv-exclude-content mt-6\" data-no-optimize=\"1\"><div data-slot=\"table-container\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-x-auto\"><table data-slot=\"table\" class=\"caption-bottom text-sm w-max min-w-full\"><thead data-slot=\"table-header\" class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b bg-muted\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Item</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Point Cost</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Value/Use</th></tr></thead><tbody data-slot=\"table-body\" class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/ultraball\">Ultra Ball</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">2 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle 