data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/rarecandy\">Rare Candy</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">4 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Instant level up</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/eviolite\">Eviolite</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">5 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Boosts Defense/Sp. Def of unevolved Pokémon</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/ppup\">PP Up</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">6 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Permanently increase move PP</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/abilitycapsule\">Ability Capsule</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">7 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">Changes Pokémon&#x27;s ability</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"recommended-redemptions\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#recommended-redemptions\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Recommended Redemptions</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Early Game (Before Elite Four):</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Ultra Balls</strong> (2 pts) - Useful for catching Legendaries and rare Pokémon</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Full Restore</strong> (2 pts) - Cost-effective healing for tough battles</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Elixir</strong> (2 pts) - PP restoration during long dungeons</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Mid-Game:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Max Elixir</strong> (3 pts) - Full PP restoration before Gym Leaders/Elite Four</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Rare Candies</strong> (4 pts) - Level underleveled team members quickly</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Nuggets</strong> (3 pts) - Convert points to money (¥1,667 per point)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Ability Capsule</strong> (7 pts) - Change abilities without breeding</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Late Game/Post-Game:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">PP Up</strong> (6 pts) - Permanent PP increases for competitive movesets.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Tip! You can reset time using down + b on the title screen to quickly farm points by changing the day! This makes it super easy to get Ability Patches basically as soon as you can get to the daycare.</p>\n<!--$--><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-full w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\"></div></div></div><!--/$-->\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"optimal-usage-strategy\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#optimal-usage-strategy\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Optimal Usage Strategy</h2>\n<h3 id=\"daily-routine\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#daily-routine\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Daily Routine</h3>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Visit between 6:00 PM - 12:00 AM</strong> every day</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Guess the password (takes ~30 seconds)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Save points for high-value items rather than spending immediately</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Redeem before major challenges (Gym battles, Elite Four, Legendaries)</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"time-efficiency\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#time-efficiency\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Time Efficiency</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Total Time:</strong> ~1 minute per day</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Annual Value:</strong> 182+ Ultra Balls, 91+ Rare Candies, or 52+ Ability Capsules per year</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">One of the best daily events</strong> for resource generation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"integration-with-other-dailies\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#integration-with-other-dailies\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Integration with Other Dailies</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Combine with other daily events in Goldenrod:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Berry Girl</strong> (Department Store 5F) - Free berries</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Loto-ID</strong> (Radio Tower 1F) - Lottery prizes</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Haircut Brothers</strong> (Underground Tunnel) - Friendship boosts</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Visit all three in one trip to maximize efficiency.</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"common-questions\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#common-questions\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Common Questions</h2>\n<h3 id=\"can-i-do-this-before-getting-the-radio-card\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#can-i-do-this-before-getting-the-radio-card\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Can I do this before getting the Radio Card?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">No, you must obtain the Radio Card from the Radio Tower receptionist.</p>\n<h3 id=\"what-happens-if-i-dont-visit-daily\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#what-happens-if-i-dont-visit-daily\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>What happens if I don&#x27;t visit daily?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">You simply miss that day&#x27;s point. There&#x27;s no penalty, but you lose potential accumulation.</p>\n<h3 id=\"is-there-a-maximum-point-limit\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#is-there-a-maximum-point-limit\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Is there a maximum point limit?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">No, you can accumulate points indefinitely.</p>\n<h3 id=\"can-i-visit-after-midnight\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#can-i-visit-after-midnight\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Can I visit after midnight?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">No, Buena is only available from 6:00 PM to 12:00 AM. The event resets at midnight.</p>\n<h3 id=\"whats-the-best-item-to-save-for\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#whats-the-best-item-to-save-for\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>What&#x27;s the best item to save for?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Ability Capsule</strong> (7 points) is the most valuable long-term since it&#x27;s otherwise very difficult to obtain. <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Eviolite</strong> (5 points) is excellent if you use unevolved Pokémon. For casual players, <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Ultra Balls</strong> (2 points) and <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Full Restore</strong> (2 points) provide immediate utility.</p>","titleZh":"Buena's Password","descriptionZh":"Complete 指南 to Buena's Password mini-game in 抛光水晶. Learn 如何 earn Blue Card points, daily password mechanics, and redeem points for rare 物品 like Ultra Balls, Rare Candies, and Nuggets.","htmlZh":"<h2 id=\"简介\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#简介\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>简介</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Buena&#x27;s Password, meanwhile, is a daily mini-game one can participate in within the <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/地点/goldenrodcity\">Goldenrod Radio 塔</a> to receive Blue Card Points through correctly guessing its password. That can be turned in for a selection of pretty nice 物品, including Rare Candies, Ultra Balls, and 特性 Capsules.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">This is a very low-effort daily activity that pays dividends throughout a playthrough, making it worth visiting every evening!</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#getting-started\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Getting Started</h2>\n<h3 id=\"prerequisites\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#prerequisites\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Prerequisites</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Access 需要:</strong> Obtain the <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/radiocard\">Radio Card</a> from the Radio 塔 receptionist. You can get the card on your first visit!</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">地点:</strong> <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/地点/goldenrodcity\">Goldenrod Radio 塔</a>, 2nd Floor</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">时间:</strong> 6:00 PM - 12:00 AM (Midnight)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Frequency:</strong> Once per 白天</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"how-to-start\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#how-to-start\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>如何 Start</h3>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Visit the Goldenrod Radio 塔 2nd Floor between 6:00 PM and midnight</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Talk to <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Buena</strong> at her desk</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">She&#x27;ll give you a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Blue Card</strong> on your first visit</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Listen to her radio show for the daily password hint</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Return and guess the password for points</li>\n</ol>\n<!--$--><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-full w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex flex-col 物品-center gap-2 text-center\"></div></div></div><!--/$-->\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"password-mechanics\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#password-mechanics\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Password Mechanics</h2>\n<h3 id=\"finding-the-password\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#finding-the-password\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Finding the Password</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The password is a specfic word, such as a 宝可梦 or 物品. Buena says the password during her radio show:</p>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Tune your radio to <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Buena&#x27;s Password</strong> (automatic when talking to her)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Listen for the password</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Speak to Buena and repeat the password</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">提示:</strong> The password changes daily and is randomized, so there&#x27;s no pattern to memorize.</p>\n<h3 id=\"guessing-strategy\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#guessing-strategy\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Guessing Strategy</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Honestly, there isn&#x27;t much strategy to be had here. It&#x27;s a guessing game and Buena will tell you what the password is via the radio station. You can write it down, but otherwise this is super simple.</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"blue-card-points- and- 奖励\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#blue-card-points--奖励\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Blue Card Points &amp; 奖励</h2>\n<h3 id=\"earning-points\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#earning-points\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Earning Points</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Correct Password:</strong> 1 point per 白天</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Points Accumulate:</strong> Save up for expensive 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"prize-list\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#prize-list\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Prize List</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Points can be redeemed for 物品 at Buena&#x27;s desk:</p>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mv-exclude-content mt-6\" data-no-optimize=\"1\"><div data-slot=\"table-container\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-x-auto\"><table data-slot=\"table\" class=\"caption-bottom text-sm w-max min-w-full\"><thead data-slot=\"table-header\" class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b bg-muted\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">物品</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Point Cost</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Value/Use</th></tr></thead><tbody data-slot=\"table-body\" class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/ultraball\">Ultra Ball</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">2 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">High 捕获 rate ball</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/fullrestore\">Full Restore</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">2 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Fully restores HP and status</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/elixir\">Elixir</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">2 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Restores 10 PP to all 技能</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/maxelixir\">Max Elixir</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">3 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Fully restores PP to all 技能</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/nugget\">Nugget</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">3 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Sells high</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/rarecandy\">Rare Candy</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">4 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Instant 等级 up</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/eviolite\">Eviolite</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">5 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Boosts Defense/Sp. Def of unevolved 宝可梦</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/ppup\">PP Up</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">6 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Permanently increase 技能 PP</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/物品/abilitycapsule\">特性 Capsule</a></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">7 points</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 物品-center whitespace-nowrap\">Changes 宝可梦&#x27;s 特性</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"recommended-redemptions\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#recommended-redemptions\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Recommended Redemptions</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Early Game (Before Elite Four):</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Ultra Balls</strong> (2 pts) - Useful for catching Legendaries and rare 宝可梦</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Full Restore</strong> (2 pts) - Cost-effective healing for tough 战斗</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Elixir</strong> (2 pts) - PP restoration during long dungeons</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Mid-Game:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Max Elixir</strong> (3 pts) - Full PP restoration before 道馆 Leaders/Elite Four</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Rare Candies</strong> (4 pts) - 等级 underleveled 队伍 members quickly</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Nuggets</strong> (3 pts) - Convert points to money (¥1,667 per point)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">特性 Capsule</strong> (7 pts) - Change 特性 without 繁殖</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Late Game/Post-Game:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">PP Up</strong> (6 pts) - Permanent PP increases for competitive movesets.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">提示! You can reset 时间 using down + b on the title screen to quickly farm points by changing the 白天! This makes it super easy to get 特性 Patches basically as soon as you can get to the daycare.</p>\n<!--$--><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-full w-full\" style=\"min-height:250px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"flex flex-col 物品-center gap-2 text-center\"></div></div></div><!--/$-->\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"optimal-usage-strategy\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#optimal-usage-strategy\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Optimal Usage Strategy</h2>\n<h3 id=\"daily-routine\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#daily-routine\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Daily Routine</h3>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Visit between 6:00 PM - 12:00 AM</strong> every 白天</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Guess the password (takes ~30 seconds)</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Save points for high-value 物品 rather than spending immediately</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\">Redeem before major challenges (道馆 战斗, Elite Four, Legendaries)</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"时间-efficiency\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#时间-efficiency\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>时间 Efficiency</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Total 时间:</strong> ~1 minute per 白天</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Annual Value:</strong> 182+ Ultra Balls, 91+ Rare Candies, or 52+ 特性 Capsules per year</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">One of the best daily events</strong> for resource generation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"integration-with-other-dailies\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#integration-with-other-dailies\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Integration with Other Dailies</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Combine with other daily events in Goldenrod:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Berry Girl</strong> (Department Store 5F) - Free berries</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Loto-ID</strong> (Radio 塔 1F) - Lottery prizes</li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Haircut Brothers</strong> (Underground Tunnel) - Friendship boosts</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Visit all three in one trip to maximize efficiency.</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-border\"/>\n<h2 id=\"common-questions\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#common-questions\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Common Questions</h2>\n<h3 id=\"can-i-do-this-before-getting-the-radio-card\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#can-i-do-this-before-getting-the-radio-card\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Can I do this before getting the Radio Card?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">No, you must obtain the Radio Card from the Radio 塔 receptionist.</p>\n<h3 id=\"what-happens-if-i-dont-visit-daily\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#what-happens-if-i-dont-visit-daily\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>What happens if I don&#x27;t visit daily?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">You simply miss that 白天&#x27;s point. There&#x27;s no penalty, but you lose potential accumulation.</p>\n<h3 id=\"is-there-a-maximum-point-limit\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#is-there-a-maximum-point-limit\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Is there a maximum point limit?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">No, you can accumulate points indefinitely.</p>\n<h3 id=\"can-i-visit-after-midnight\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#can-i-visit-after-midnight\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Can I visit after midnight?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">No, Buena is only 可用 from 6:00 PM to 12:00 AM. The event resets at midnight.</p>\n<h3 id=\"whats-the-best-物品-to-save-for\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#whats-the-best-物品-to-save-for\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>What&#x27;s the best 物品 to save for?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">特性 Capsule</strong> (7 points) is the most valuable long-term since it&#x27;s otherwise very difficult to obtain. <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Eviolite</strong> (5 points) is excellent if you use unevolved 宝可梦. For casual players, <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Ultra Balls</strong> (2 points) and <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Full Restore</strong> (2 points) provide immediate utility.</p>"}